{"logId": "b4eb561a-f708-4ede-aadc-a526c0d9f6cb", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [311, 120, 734, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [734.0, 120.0], [734.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：能够轻松驾驭金钱，金钱和物质的多少不影响生活的幸福度，更在意精神价值的创造。（生活阶段）", "block_bbox": [309, 231, 1549, 309], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 231.0], [1549.0, 231.0], [1549.0, 309.0], [309.0, 309.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：对钱已经看开了，不会因为金钱问题给自己造成烦恼，也不计较自己的得与失，多了多花、少了少花，不因为物质影响自己的幸福度！更注重在意的是精神价值的创造，能给自己和他人带来多少的精神力量。", "block_bbox": [309, 344, 1555, 468], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 344.0], [1555.0, 344.0], [1555.0, 468.0], [309.0, 468.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 533, 484, 565], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 533.0], [484.0, 533.0], [484.0, 565.0], [311.0, 565.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、公司分不分股份都无所谓，工资已经足够了，更在意的是在喜欢的工作岗位上，和一群志同道合的人共事，非常有价值、感到满足和幸福", "block_bbox": [334, 591, 1554, 669], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 591.0], [1554.0, 591.0], [1554.0, 669.0], [334.0, 669.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、发自内心的喜欢做事，没有上班和退休的概念，更珍惜的是有公司这样的平台，乐在其中", "block_bbox": [335, 681, 1411, 714], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 681.0], [1411.0, 681.0], [1411.0, 714.0], [335.0, 714.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、不会在意和对比自己与他人的贡献和所得，因为自己精神世界的富足", "block_bbox": [336, 726, 1177, 758], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 726.0], [1177.0, 726.0], [1177.0, 758.0], [336.0, 758.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、希望更多人懂得物质财富和精神财富的价值，也能够驾驭更多的物质财富、造福更多人", "block_bbox": [336, 771, 1387, 804], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 771.0], [1387.0, 771.0], [1387.0, 804.0], [336.0, 804.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[80]", "block_bbox": [913, 968, 956, 993], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[913.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [913.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8629770278930664, "coordinate": [311, 120, 734, 164], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [734.0, 120.0], [734.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8024258017539978, "coordinate": [309, 231, 1549, 309], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 231.0], [1549.0, 231.0], [1549.0, 309.0], [309.0, 309.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9467027187347412, "coordinate": [309, 344, 1555, 468], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 344.0], [1555.0, 344.0], [1555.0, 468.0], [309.0, 468.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8191825747489929, "coordinate": [311, 533, 484, 565], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 533.0], [484.0, 533.0], [484.0, 565.0], [311.0, 565.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9308422803878784, "coordinate": [334, 591, 1554, 669], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[334.0, 591.0], [1554.0, 591.0], [1554.0, 669.0], [334.0, 669.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8708252906799316, "coordinate": [335, 681, 1411, 714], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[335.0, 681.0], [1411.0, 681.0], [1411.0, 714.0], [335.0, 714.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8565201163291931, "coordinate": [336, 726, 1177, 758], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 726.0], [1177.0, 726.0], [1177.0, 758.0], [336.0, 758.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8647001385688782, "coordinate": [336, 771, 1387, 804], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 771.0], [1387.0, 771.0], [1387.0, 804.0], [336.0, 804.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.702461838722229, "coordinate": [913, 968, 956, 993], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[913.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [913.0, 992.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n## 四 级【3~4分】：能够轻松驾驭金钱，金钱和物质的多少不影响生活的幸福度，更在意精神价值的创造。（生活阶段）\n\n- 本条释义：对钱已经看开了，不会因为金钱问题给自己造成烦恼，也不计较自己的得与失，多了多花、少了少花，不因为物质影响自己的幸福度！更注重在意的是精神价值的创造，能给自己和他人带来多少的精神力量。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、公司分不分股份都无所谓，工资已经足够了，更在意的是在喜欢的工作岗位上，和一群志同道合的人共事，非常有价值、感到满足和幸福\n\n2、发自内心的喜欢做事，没有上班和退休的概念，更珍惜的是有公司这样的平台，乐在其中\n\n3、不会在意和对比自己与他人的贡献和所得，因为自己精神世界的富足\n\n4、希望更多人懂得物质财富和精神财富的价值，也能够驾驭更多的物质财富、造福更多人", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b4eb561a-f708-4ede-aadc-a526c0d9f6cb/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A42%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F5186ac0f28291e41b870ed2f09c7ef06a2445c9d05b37f7a4ca6487cb63f42f0"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b4eb561a-f708-4ede-aadc-a526c0d9f6cb/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A42%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F4b9d22ecd99080c02f39f7ead3a11e832028e7405c51ee1ff2ccde8bef941037"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com